[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0071","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-31996","title":"OpenClaw safeBins 输入验证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenClaw 工具集 tools.exec.safeBins 组件存在输入验证绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过 sort 命令的 -o 输出标志参数实现任意文件写入，或通过 grep 命令的 -R 递归标志参数实现任意文件读取，绕过原本仅允许标准输入的限制。该漏洞影响 2026.2.19 之前的所有 OpenClaw 版本，CVSS 评分 2.0，危害等级低。攻击者需具备命令执行权限方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-31996"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-03-19T02:16:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:34:54Z","remediation":"升级 OpenClaw 至 2026.2.19 或更新版本，该版本已修复 safeBins 的 stdin-only 检查绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可限制 tools.exec.safeBins 中允许的命令列表，禁止使用含有 -o（sort）或 -R（grep）等危险 flag 的命令，或在调用层对命令参数进行白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/2c05cbb43e48ebad03626d3125746fb1b9a8520f","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp95","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openclaw-safebins-stdin-only-bypass-via-sort-output-and-recursive-grep-flags","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/2026/31xxx/CVE-2026-31996.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/npm/openclaw/CVE-2026-31996.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-31996.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/31xxx/CVE-2026-31996.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-31996.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/c2a7366c6314deb6352bda7e9037ec2fa014f8f8/threat/cve-2026-31996---openclaw-2026219---safebins-stdin-only-bypass-via-sort-output-a.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/02/GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp95/GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp9