"aliases":["CVE-2026-0954"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-13T19:53:57Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:11:40Z","remediation":"目前 Digilent 尚未发布修复该漏洞的补丁，所有版本的 DASYLab 均受影响。建议用户不要打开来自不可信来源或未知发件人的 .DSB 文件，避免点击可疑链接或下载未经验证的 DASYLab 项目文件。同时关注 Digilent 官方安全更新页面（https://www.ni.com/en/support/security/），待补丁发布后立即升级至最新版本。由于该漏洞需要用户交互（打开恶意文件）才能利用，加强用户安全意识培训可有效降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.ni.com/en/support/security/available-critical-and-security-updates-for-ni-software/2026/out-of-bounds-write-vulnerabilities-in-digilent-dasylab.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/0xxx/CVE-2026-0954.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/0xxx/CVE-2026-0954.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-0954.md","https://github.com/ni/product-security-center/blob/7ca65928b6784ba5233521dd8a4b24877dacdb44/csaf/advisories/2026/ni_cve-2026-0954.json.sha512","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/711ada085657a1a7fef681a61a8a60dcf3289d23/threat/cve-2026-0954---digilent-dasylab-out-of-bounds-write-memory-corruption-vulnerabi.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-jvwv-r6g5-hh7c/GHSA-jvwv-r6g5-hh7c.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-03-14_zh.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-0954.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-0954.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/CNAScoreCard/blob/739997c9b73c56505b98206eefe03346a41d57c0/web/data/cna/NI__CNA-2023-0003.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0453.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0538","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27278","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用漏洞，影响版本包括 24.001.30307、24.001.30308、25.001.21265 及更早版本。攻击者可构造恶意 PDF 文件，诱导受害者打开后触发内存释放后重用错误，导致在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞利用需要用户交互（打开恶意文件），CVSS 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地，完整性/机密性/可用性均受高影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27278"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-10T22:16:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:26:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Acrobat Reader 至最新版本：Acrobat Reader DC Continuous 用户升级到 25.001.21288 及以上版本，Acrobat Classic 用户升级到 24.001.30356 及以上版本。可通过「帮助 > 检查更新」自动安装，或从官网下载完整安装包。临时缓解措施：在受信任环境中禁用 PDF 文件的自动打开行为，避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文档，并启用 Adobe Reader 的受保护视图（编辑 > 首选项 > 安全性（增强）> 启动时启用增强安全功能）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-26.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27278.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27278.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-27278","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-27278.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-7q7m-rc75-vrr5/GHSA-7q7m-rc75-vrr5.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-27278","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27278.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-03-11_zh.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-361.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-27278.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0538.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0537","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27220","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意 PDF 文件并诱使用户打开，触发已释放内存对象的非法访问，进而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Acrobat Reader 24.001.30307、24.001.30308、25.001.21265 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。利用该漏洞需要用户交互，即受害者必须手动打开恶意文件。Adobe 官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27220"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-10T22:16:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:26:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Acrobat Reader DC 至 25.001.21288 及以上版本，或 Acrobat Classic 2024 至 24.001.30356 及以上版本。可通过 Adobe 官网或产品内置更新功能获取补丁（参考 APSB26-26）。在无法立即升级时，建议禁用 PDF 文件的自动打开功能，并教育用户不要打开来源不明的 PDF 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-26.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27220.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27220.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-27220","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-27220.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-32vc-25c9-wqww/GHSA-32vc-25c9-wqww.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-27220","https://github.com/MaikCyberSec/Threat-Hunting-/blob/7ef2021450bfa01e8d4a75fd2e47138ac4f7b57e/Adobe%20Reader%200-Day%20PDF%20Exploit%20-%20Data%20Theft%20&%20System%20Fingerprinting%20(CVE-2026-27220)/CVE-2026-27220_Detection.kql","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27220.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-03-11_zh.md","https://github.com/RogoLabs/CNAScoreCard/blob/f55dfa87aa769a456b7e2f07b366061b62759da0/web/data/cna/adobe.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0006","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-0006","title":"Google Android 多个组件堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Android 系统多个位置存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过特制网络数据包触发越界读写。该漏洞无需用户交互即可远程利用，且不需要任何执行权限，成功利用后可导致任意代码执行，完全控制目标设备。影响包括 Android 16 在内的多个版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-0006","CNNVD-2026-10345968"],"sources":["cve","cnnvd"],"published":"2026-03-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Android 安全补丁级别 2026-03-05 或更高版本。进入设置 > 系统 > 系统更新，检查并安装更新。企业用户应通过 MDM 策略强制推送安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T23:00:00Z","references":["https://source.android.com/docs/security/bulletin/2026/2026-03-01"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0257","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28231","title":"bigcat88 pillow-heif 编码路径缓冲区验证整数溢出漏洞","description":"pillow-heif 库的编码路径缓冲区验证中存在整数溢出漏洞。当攻击者提供特制的大尺寸 HEIF 图像时，`_pillow_heif.c` 中的 `_CtxWriteImage_add_plane()` 函数在缓冲区边界检查时发生整数溢出，导致堆越界读取。该漏洞可在默认配置下触发，无需特殊权限，可能导致服务器堆内存泄露至编码图像中（信息泄露）或进程崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 pillow-heif 1.3.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。建议升级至 1.3.0 或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28231","GHSA-5gjj-6r7v-ph3x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-27T20:21:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:28:22Z","remediation":"升级 pillow-heif 至 1.3.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了编码路径缓冲区验证中的整数溢出问题。如无法立即升级，应避免处理来自不可信来源的超大 HEIF 图片文件，并限制图片尺寸输入范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/commit/8305a15d3780c533b762578cbe987d27a2c59c7a","https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/releases/tag/v1.3.0","https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/security/advisories/GHSA-5gjj-6r7v-ph3x","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-28231.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28231.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/pi-heif/CVE-2026-28231.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-03-01_2026-03-19/TIER_2_CVE-2026-28231.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28231.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-28231.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/pi-heif/PYSEC-2026-2248.yaml","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/7cc613328d649b293f694d9c455d79676ac23def/packages/p/python-pillow-heif/.rev","https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/blob/7127731b75cdc7872ff0e26255fab8cb32204e75/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0068","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26324","title":"OpenClaw SSRF 防护绕过漏洞","description":"OpenClaw 个人 AI 助手存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）防护绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过构造完整格式的 IPv4 映射 IPv6 地址（如 `0:0:0:0:0:ffff:7f00:1`，即 `127.0.0.1`）绕过 SSRF 防护机制，向本应被拦截的环回地址、私有网络或链路本地元数据端点发起请求，可能导致敏感信息泄露或内网探测。该漏洞影响 2026.2.14 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。开发者已在 2026.2.14 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26324"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-02-19T23:16:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:26:05Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenClaw 2026.2.14 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在网络层或应用层防火墙添加规则，拦截包含 0:0:0:0:0:ffff: 前缀的 IPv4-mapped IPv6 请求目标，并限制出站请求仅允许白名单目标地址。同时审查 SSRF 防护逻辑，确保 IPv6 字面量也被正确解析和过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/c0c0e0f9aecb913e738742f73e091f2f72d39a19","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/releases/tag/v2026.2.14","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-jrvc-8ff5-2f9f","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-26324"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0068.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0253","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26193","title":"Open WebUI iFrame嵌入响应消息存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款自托管的离线人工智能平台，其响应消息中的 iFrame 嵌入功能存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。攻击者通过手动修改聊天历史记录，在响应消息中设置恶意的 `embeds` 属性，该属性内容被加载到 iFrame 中时，沙箱策略配置了 `allow-scripts` 和 `allow-same-origin` 权限，绕过了系统的 \"iframe Sandbox Allow Same Origin\" 安全配置。攻击者可将包含恶意载荷的聊天链接分享给同一实例上的其他用户，触发 XSS 攻击，导致用户会话劫持或敏感信息窃取。该漏洞影响 0.6.44 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高，建议用户升级至 0.6.44 或更高版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26193","GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-19T20:25:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:25:55Z","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 0.6.44 或以上版本，该版本修复了 iFrame embed 未正确遵循沙箱配置的问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层配置 Content-Security-Policy 头，限制 frame-src 和 script-src 来源，并禁用 iframe 的 allow-same-origin 和 allow-scripts 权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/6f1486ffd0cb288d0e21f41845361924e0d742b3/src/lib/components/chat/Messages/ResponseMessage.svelte#L689-L703","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26193.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-26193.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-26193.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26193.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/96dab026b1d19f98191e031637542a72caf337dc/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-26193/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6bd321daede8b80ea61873e82166bcee99250c6a/cve/CVE-2026-26193.html","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-26193-open-webui-vulnerable-to-stored-xss-via-iframe-embeds-in-response-messages.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc/GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-26193.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/960c38c8fcadb4782e86773e98d193e1c5a308f1/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29524.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0253.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0049","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26192","title":"Open WebUI 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款自托管的离线 AI 平台，其引文预览功能存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。攻击者通过手动篡改聊天历史记录，在文档元数据中设置恶意的 `html` 属性，使前端将文档内容作为 HTML 渲染并在 iFrame 中预览引文，从而注入并执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该 payload 在共享聊天中查看引文时同样生效。漏洞影响 0.7.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。攻击者需具备修改聊天历史的能力，利用难度较低，可导致会话劫持、数据窃取等后果。官方已在 0.7.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26192","GHSA-xc8p-9rr6-97r2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-19T20:25:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:25:55Z","remediation":"立即将 Open WebUI 升级至 v0.7.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过 iFrame 渲染文档 HTML 内容导致的存储型 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层过滤或转义用户上传文档中 metadata 的 html 属性值，避免前端直接渲染为 HTML。同时建议限制非受信用户修改聊天历史记录的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/6f1486ffd0cb288d0e21f41845361924e0d742b3/src/lib/components/chat/Messages/Citations/CitationModal.svelte#L163-L170","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-xc8p-9rr6-97r2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-26192.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26192.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-26192.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26192.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/96dab026b1d19f98191e031637542a72caf337dc/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-26192/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6bd321daede8b80ea61873e82166bcee99250c6a/cve/CVE-2026-26192.html","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-26192.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-26192-open-webui-vulnerable-to-stored-xss-via-iframe-in-citations-model.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/open-webui/PYSEC-2026-2769.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0049.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0252","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0252.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25527","title":"changedetection.io 未授权静态路径遍历漏洞","description":"changedetection.io 是一款开源网页变更检测工具，其 `/static/<group>/<filename>` 路由存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可将 `group` 参数设置为 `..`，导致 `send_from_directory` 函数将基目录上移至 `/app/changedetectionio`，从而读取应用源码文件（如 `flask_app.py`）。该漏洞影响 0.53.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危，可能导致敏感信息泄露。厂商已在 0.53.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25527","GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-19T15:16:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:24:47Z","remediation":"升级至 changedetection.io 0.53.2 及以上版本，该版本修复了 `/static/<group>/<filename>` 路由的路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层面（如 Nginx）添加规则，过滤含 `..` 的静态路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/dgtlmoon/changedetection.io/commit/9d38b4517364831889b5b0d7b3465fd060403fd4","https://github.com/dgtlmoon/changedetection.io/security/advisories/GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-25527.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25527.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25527.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-25527.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw/GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-25527.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/9238de8f3cf6aee095a9c59813ce1d5bb6ba2585/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/c2a438961cf6a6c47831738d9c79cfc3110107fc/data/lists/NucleiList.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0513","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0513.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-21518","title":"GitHub Copilot 和 Visual Studio Code 命令注入安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"GitHub Copilot 和 Visual Studio Code 的 Copilot Chat 扩展中存在命令注入漏洞（CWE-77），由于对用户输入中特殊元素的过滤不充分，未经授权的远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意链接或打开特制文件，在目标系统上注入并执行任意命令，从而绕过安全功能。攻击者利用此漏洞可获取机密信息、篡改数据或完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Visual Studio Code Copilot Chat 扩展 0.27.0 至 0.37.1 之前版本及 Visual Studio Code 1.0.